{{Quote|I've never even heard of Toopil.''"<br />"''It doesn't exist officially.|Luke Skywalker and [[Laneet Chekkoo]]|<ref name="Heir to the Jedi" />}}
'''Toopil''' was a complex on the [[planet]] [[Rodia]] that consisted of a [[cantina]], a handful of meeting rooms, a smugglers' den, and dormitories. It also had a private [[Hangar|docking bay]] that was suitable for most [[light freighter]]s. During his [[Mission to Rodia (Luke Skywalker)|mission]] to secure weapons for the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]], [[Luke Skywalker]] stayed in a room in Toopil in which he deconstructed the [[Huulik's lightsaber|lightsaber]] of [[Jedi Knight]] [[Huulik]].<ref name="Heir to the Jedi" />

==Description==
Toopil was a secret complex on the [[planet]] [[Rodia]] that was built underneath [[Utheel Outfitters]] in the middle of the [[jungle]]. Toopil consisted of a [[cantina]], a few meeting rooms, and dormitories for guests. Unlike most of Rodia, the inside of Toopil did not have a strong smell.<ref name="Heir to the Jedi" />

